Immediately, the affair becomes an almost presidental ending scandal. The <span style="color: #DE0100;">Republicans</span> grill us on multiple fronts; the Taliban army has gained full access to billions of dollars of US military equipment, 11 soldiers have lost their lives, and we've been completely humilated on the world stage. Our allies are downright angry at our incompentence, which costed them billions in equipment loses. Our polling numbers have completely collapsed, some are calling for us to resign. For now, our response has been to blame the whole affair on Trump's deal with the Taliban, and to hope that a sucessful domestic agenda will lead to Americans putting this affair behind them by the time important elections come up 
